Z||000012||rockcrawl||08-26-2001||10:26 PM||||The green car is owned by Chad Colfer. You really need to see the car in person to appreciate the paint job. The graphics continue throughout the door jambs. It took hundreds of hours just to do the airbrushing. I was lucky enough to get to drive the car to Raceway park in Englishtown NJ today, and he even let me run it down the dragstrip. Here's a pic I took today right before we left the East Coast Truck and Hot Rod Nationals. He came home with two trophies for the car.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/DCP01421.jpg"> ||||reg||1
